b) preliminary investigation;
c) detailed investigation;
d) construction stage investigation; and e) post-construction stage investigation.

3.3 Subsurface Exploration
The subsurface exploration includes the following:
a) Geophysical investigation;
b) Trial pits;
c) Subsurface soundings;
d) Boring in soil;
e) Core drilling in rock; and f) Location and depth of investigation.

